\par Summary:
\par }\pard\plain \widctlpar\adjustright \f1\cgrid {We\rquote re only at the }{\ul very}{
 beginning of the Net revolution. The most exciting part is still to come. Soon it will become as easy to interact with programs and data all over the net as it currently is to view shared presentation and content.  
\par }}